<title>CHINA: HK Parkview year net returns to profit.</title>
<headline>HK Parkview year net returns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	28.93 gain    vs 9.05 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) 10.0	    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     nil	     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			 154.26 profit vs 48.22 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		  797.87	  vs 556.17</p>
<p>    Company name	    Hong Kong Parkview Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     September 5-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	October 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Hong Kong Parkview engages in property investment, passenger vessel operations, shipbuilding and marine engineering.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 13 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
